    <string name="txt_eventos_content">Clicking on the main button we open the calendar. The event days have a point of distinction. The events planned for the selected day are shown in the lower half</string>
    <string name="txt_add_evento_content">Press the button that is at the bottom right with a plus symbol, enter the details in the floating dialog and press Save to add a new event to the selected date</string>
    <string name="txt_eliminar_evento">When you tap an event, the Save or Delete button will appear in the event editor. Tap Delete to remove the event. Alternatively, tap and hold the event you want to delete and then tap "Delete" in the pop-up window.</string>
