    <string name="txt_subir_documento">To upload a document, click the "Create" button in the bottom right corner. Once you have selected the document, a dialog box will appear where you can name it and select its folder.</string>
    <string name="txt_descargar_documento">To download the document, click on the document you want to download. This will open a window where you can view and download the file.</string>
    <string name="txt_crear_comentario">To create a comment, you have to press the create button, enter the tittle and the comment.</string>
    <string name="txt_editar_comentario">To edit, you have to click on a comment and you will be able to edit the tittle and the comment, you can only edit your comments</string>
    <string name="txt_eliminar_comentario">To delete, you have to click on a comment and you will see a button to delete it, you can only delete your comments</string>
