    <string name="txt_hacer_fotos">To take photos, you must first grant the necessary camera permissions. Once activated, press the button with the camera icon in bottom right corner of the screen to capture the image.</string>
    <string name="txt_galeria">GALLERY</string>
    <string name="txt_entrar_galeria">To access your gallery, tap the desire folder. This will display all the photos stored in that folder.</string>
    <string name="icono_estado">representation icon of the tasks status</string>
    <string name="txt_descripcion_perfil">It shows you the data with the user you logged in with.</string>
    <string name="txt_descripcion_configuracion">Settings panel where you can choose the application theme (automatic) and select which tools you want to see in your main menu.</string>
    <string name="txt_descripcion_fotos">It allows you to take photographs and access to photography folders.</string>
    <string name="txt_descripcion_contactos">It allows you to easily view, search, add, and edit your contact information from a centralized list.</string>
    <string name="txt_descripcion_redsocial">Interactive wall to publish, edit and share messages in real time with the rest of the team.</string>
    <string name="txt_descripcion_documentos">Its the files gestor of the app. Here you can organize your documents in folders</string>
    <string name="txt_descripcion_tareas">Organize your to-dos with statuses (Done, In Progress, Pending). Tap the colored buttons at the top to instantly filter the list and see only the tasks with that status.</string>
    <string name="txt_descripcion_calendario">Organize your daily events clearly. Add new appointments with details (attendees, time, and description) and quickly view your entire schedule.</string>
